Third-party material

This product bundles third-party material under its own licenses. The per-file list (what it
is, where it came from, its license status) is in ATTRIBUTION.md.

- The koala artwork in assets/brand/ was generated by the owner with Windows Copilot (a
  licensed copy, run locally on the developer machine). The owner states that its terms allow
  using and distributing the output, including in releases of this project. That was not
  independently checked. The artwork is
  NOT covered by the license above. See ATTRIBUTION.md.
- Noto Naskh Arabic, Noto Sans Hebrew and Noto Sans Devanagari (assets/fonts/) - SIL Open
  Font License 1.1, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors. Bundled unmodified so that
  Arabic, Hebrew and Devanagari have glyphs on a machine that has no such font installed;
  each licence text sits beside its font as assets/fonts/OFL-*.txt.
- The KaTeX maths fonts (assets/fonts/katex/) - SIL Open Font License 1.1, Copyright 2009-2010
  Design Science, Inc. and 2014-2018 Khan Academy, with Reserved Font Names KaTeX_*. Bundled
  unmodified so equations draw in real maths fonts; the licence text is
  assets/fonts/katex/OFL-KaTeX.txt, written from the licence strings inside the fonts.
- mermaid-rs-renderer - MIT License, by its authors, linked into the program to draw Mermaid diagrams.
- RaTeX (ratex-parser, ratex-layout, ratex-types, ratex-font) - MIT License, by the RaTeX
  authors, linked into the program to typeset equations.
- PDF printouts are drawn with the hayro crates (Laurenz Stampfl), used under the MIT License,
  and with substitute fonts from PDFium (Foxit Software Inc. copyright) compiled into the program.
  The notices those licences require are in licenses/PDF-RENDERING-NOTICES.txt, which ships with
  every build. See ATTRIBUTION.md.
- The window also uses the fonts bundled with egui, which carry their own licenses; those ship
  with the egui crates.
- Dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock, each under its own license. A license audit of them
  (for example with cargo deny) has not been run.
- The pictures in docs/images/ are screenshots of NoteCraft itself, made by its own test
  harness. They contain the koala artwork above.

The notes in docs/research/ paraphrase Microsoft's published specifications [MS-ONESTORE] and
[MS-ONE]. No Microsoft text, code or assets are included.
